 "cells_about": "One cell per framework the compatibility workflow installs alone, at its lowest supported and its newest release: the extras it installs, the import names they provide, the unit test modules it runs (a module importing another framework at its top cannot be collected without it) and the framework whose end-to-end tests it runs (SAM_E2E_FRAMEWORK). Hermes is not on PyPI: its cell installs a checkout (compat/pins.json at the floor, the head of its main branch as the newest) and records the commit as the version of hermes-agent.",
